+      "title": "What you already know",
+      "content": "You know *francamente*, *indudablemente*, *en realidad*, *en rigor*, *propiamente dicho* and *lamentablemente* from B2 Unit 1: these are stance adverbs. A stance adverb steps outside the action and comments on the whole sentence: how sure, how exact or how sad the writer is. In writing about the colonial past they do two jobs: they mark a correction (*en realidad*) and they say how certain you are (*indudablemente*)."
     },
