+      "title": "Two rules to keep",
+      "content": "The verb and the adjective agree with the subject that comes after them: *Duro era el trabajo*, *Duros eran los días*, not *Duros era los días*. The subject stays behind the verb: *Duro el trabajo era* sounds unnatural. Plain order is still the usual order; fronting is for the moment you want to stress."
